
"smart_sources:Gemini对话/品牌设计/LOGO设计/2026-04/W3/2026-04-21_A macro product photograph foc_154.md": {"path":"Gemini对话/品牌设计/LOGO设计/2026-04/W3/2026-04-21_A macro product photograph foc_154.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"19hd3te","at":1778495712272},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1778425872755,"size":4112,"at":1778495712273,"hash":"19hd3te"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"##A macro product photograph focusing on the serial number engraved on a used iPhone 13 Pro metal frame and the battery text, both appearing logic-board out. The phone components are carefully laid out on a clean, dark grey anti-static mat, like evidence. A magnifying glass is positioned over the serial number. Reflected subtly in the magnifying glass and the polished surface of the phone frame, the viewer can see the reflection of the East Asian man's wire-rim glasses and a focused eye from image_1.png, implying his meticulous inspection. The surrounding components have small, printed paper evidence tags with codes like \"Evidence #ZC-2026-V2\". Lighting is focused, like a surgical light, highlighting metallic textures. Cinematic suspense style. Shallow depth of field, focused on the serial number. Cold, metallic colors. --ar 16:9 --iw 0.5":[11,12],"##A macro product photograph focusing on the serial number engraved on a used iPhone 13 Pro metal frame and the battery text, both appearing logic-board out. The phone components are carefully laid out on a clean, dark grey anti-static mat, like evidence. A magnifying glass is positioned over the serial number. Reflected subtly in the magnifying glass and the polished surface of the phone frame, the viewer can see the reflection of the East Asian man's wire-rim glasses and a focused eye from image_1.png, implying his meticulous inspection. The surrounding components have small, printed paper evidence tags with codes like \"Evidence #ZC-2026-V2\". Lighting is focused, like a surgical light, high